# Google Maps Platform API Key for React + Vite
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your API key.
#
# Quickstart (Zero-Billing Prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card required for the Demo Key)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms and generate your key
# 4. Paste the key below in .env.local (never commit .env.local)
#
# For production, create and restrict an API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Elevation API

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
